'' A USTRING with static storage and an initialiser is TKO0628, as a 'string' is (fbc's
'' 87): nothing lowers the initialiser, so 'static names( 0 to 2 ) as ustring = { ... }'
'' and 'dim shared' alike were TKO0994 (tracks-2026 TB-005). An ordinary module-level DIM
'' is not static storage and stays accepted.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -c tests/diagnostics/src/ustr-static-init.bas -o tests/diagnostics/src/ustr-static-init.o
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: ustr-static-init.bas(1,12): error TKO0628
'' EXPECT-OUT: ustr-static-init.bas(2,12): error TKO0628
'' EXPECT-OUT: ustr-static-init.bas(4,12): error TKO0628
'' EXPECT-OUT: ustr-static-init.bas(5,12): error TKO0628
'' EXPECT-OUT: ustr-static-init.bas(9,9): error TKO0628
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0994
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 5
